{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014KgHTvDTCQz67hT4iurJKZ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — causal_style_decomp_judge\\\\n\\\\n## 服务器环境 (westb-29275)\\\\n- SSH: `causal_style_decomp_judge`（~/.ssh/config 别名，免密）\\\\n- GPU: 4× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96GB, torch=2.11.0+cu130\\\\n- 环境: aml-train 镜像, conda base (`source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base`)\\\\n- 数据盘: `/root/autodl-tmp/` 250GB\\\\n- **网络**: AutoDL 网络受限，每次 SSH 会话需 `source /etc/network_turbo`\\\\n- **CUDA JIT**: `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` 需包含 `/root/miniconda3/lib/python3.12/site-packages/nvidia/cu13/lib`\\\\n- **GPU 3 有驱动异常**（100% util/0 MiB），不可用，只用 GPU 0-2\\\\n\\\\n## 模型路径\\\\n- NLI: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/nli-deberta-v3-large/`\\\\n- BERTScore: `microsoft/deberta-xlarge-mnli` 在 HF cache `/root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache/`\\\\n- Qwen3-8B: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-8B/`\\\\n- Qwen3-32B: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-32B/` ✅ 完成（17 shards, 62GB）\\\\n\\\\n## API 配置\\\\n- OpenRouter endpoint: `http://47.94.22.126/v1`，API key key_id=`openai_api_key_direct`\\\\n\\\\n## 数据\\\\n- MVP 数据: `/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/mvp_samples.jsonl` (100 条, seed=42)\\\\n- Pipeline 输出目录: `/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/`\\\\n\\\\n## MVP 结果对比 (2026-05-20)\\\\n\\\\n| 指标 | 8B (mvp_8b_ate) | 32B (mvp_32b_ate) |\\\\n|------|-----------------|-------------------|\\\\n| H1 NLI pass rate | 95% | 88% |\\\\n| NLI mean | 0.9422 | 0.8956 |\\\\n| Raw ATE | -0.0800 | -0.1023 |\\\\n| Corrected ATE | +0.1200 | +0.1023 |\\\\n| Corrected d | 0.117 | 0.104 |\\\\n| Corrected p | 0.246 | 0.332 |\\\\n| Rewrite bias | -0.200 | -0.205 |\\\\n\\\\n## Pairwise 诊断结果 (2026-05-20, pairwise_32b) — ✅ SUCCESS\\\\n\\\\n| 指标 | 值 |\\\\n|------|----|\\\\n| N (consistent) | 55 / 98 valid (56.1%) |\\\\n| Formal win rate | 69.1% (38/55) |\\\\n| Sign test p | 0.0065 ** |\\\\n| 95% CI (Wilson) | [0.560, 0.797] |\\\\n| NLI≥0.90 子集 | 73.9% (34/46), p=0.0015 ** |\\\\n\\\\n**方向不对称性：** formal→casual 78.8% (p=0.001) vs casual→formal 54.5% (p=0.832)\\\\n\\\\n## Verbosity 轴失败 (2026-05-20, verbosity_32b) — ❌ NEGATIVE\\\\n\\\\n| 指标 | Formality | Verbosity |\\\\n|------|-----------|-----------|\\\\n| NLI pass rate | 88% | **65%** ← 低于 80% 阈值 |\\\\n| NLI mean | 0.8956 | **0.6544** |\\\\n| BERTScore mean | ~0.85 | **0.7522** |\\\\n| Double-rewrite NLI | ~0.80 | **0.4847** |\\\\n\\\\n**根因分析：RATE double-rewrite 对 verbosity 轴根本不可行。**\\\\n- verbose→concise 必然删除信息点（压缩），NLI 检测到语义丢失\\\\n- concise→verbose 必然添加内容（扩展），NLI 检测到新信息引入\\\\n- Double-rewrite 累积偏移更严重（NLI 0.48，仅 4% 通过）\\\\n- 这不是 model 问题，是 verbosity 这个 style dimension 的本质特征——改变 verbosity 不可能同时保持内容不变\\\\n- **教训：不是所有 style axis 都适合 RATE counterfactual 方法。只有\\\\\\\"纯表面\\\\\\\"style（如 formality/register/tone）适合，涉及信息量变化的 axis（verbosity/complexity/detail level）本质上会改变内容。**\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策点\\\\n- Formality pairwise PASS（69.1%, p=0.006）→ formality axis 有效\\\\n- Verbosity H1 FAIL（NLI 65%）→ verbosity axis 不可行（迭代 2/2 消耗）\\\\n- 方向不对称性仍未解决（78.8% vs 54.5%）\\\\n\\\\n## 踩坑经验\\\\n- [2026-05-20] vLLM Qwen3 需要 `VLLM_USE_FLASHINFER_SAMPLER=0`（Blackwell sm120 不兼容）\\\\n- [2026-05-20] 32B FP16 单卡 96GB OK（gpu-memory-utilization=0.90 用了 88GB）\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Workers 无法长时间轮询（自动退出），长等待用 ScheduleWakeup 或 nohup+监控\\\\n- [2026-05-20] ModelScope 下载有 temp 目录机制，下载完成后自动移动 shards\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Pairwise position-controlled dual-trial 比 Likert 灵敏得多：同数据 Likert p=0.33 → pairwise p=0.006\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Verbosity axis RATE counterfactual 不可行（NLI 65%），因为改变 verbosity 必然改变信息量\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Worker 长时间任务容易因 context 耗尽退出——把长等待放 nohup 后台，Worker 只做 ssh_execute 等待完成\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3165, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XyEJot4dvSG7bL5tvv1urF","session_id":"e3a9c93d-dffd-